# The root composer.json is the PHP package's manifest, so a `composer install`
# at the root resolves it. Its output is not tracked: php/composer.lock is the
# lockfile this repository maintains and tests against, and a second one here
# would be a copy nothing installs from.
/vendor/
/composer.lock
